}

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ver historial
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuario/4/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ver historial
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuario/historial-alertas/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}